# nvfbc-relay policy replay fixture
# Avatar 60 fps with frame generation OFF on the D3D11 flip present (b:flip): all nine benchmark tests across three bench runs, desktop trimmed off both ends, every inter-test fade kept. Single-member batches through the stalls as well as the gameplay, so a fade leaves the bracket one-sided rather than merely wider.
# units: microseconds. first value absolute, rest are deltas.
description Avatar 60 fps with frame generation OFF on the D3D11 flip present (b:flip): all nine benchmark tests across three bench runs, desktop trimmed off both ends, every inter-test fade kept. Single-member batches through the stalls as well as the gameplay, so a fade leaves the bracket one-sided rather than merely wider.
# What the RELAY did on this capture. The replay model is only trustworthy
# for a configuration where it reproduces these; the test checks that.
