field_long_runs 4
field_synth_pct 2.8
src_hint 60.0
# Replay 3.8% / runs 5 / worst 143 against field 2.8% / runs 4 / worst 82. The model
# OVER-predicts here, which is the safe direction: it is not inventing stability the capture
# does not have, it is finding a longer synth run through the fades than the relay did. That
# is the single-member-batch stall showing its teeth - with no second member, a fade leaves
# the bracket ONE-SIDED rather than merely wider, and one-sided is where the model and the
# field diverge most. The x2 bench fixture sees the same fades with paired arrivals and agrees
# exactly, so the pair brackets the effect.
